{
  "_comment": [
    "The things the child is asked to say, in the order the Next button walks through them.",
    "Edited by hand. Fields per item:",
    "  id       unique name, used later to save recordings against it",
    "  show     what is printed big at the top of the screen",
    "  say      how to say it, spelled out for a grown-up reading over the child's shoulder",
    "  example  a word that starts with the sound (shown small)",
    "  target   the phonemes the model should hear, using tokens from vocab.json",
    "  alsoOk   other phoneme sequences that also count as right. Stops get target + 'ə'",
    "           because children say /b/ as 'buh' (see CLAUDE.md, trailing-vowel tolerance).",
    "Vowels are the short sounds (a as in apple). The model has no separate 'uh' (ʌ) token:",
    "TIMIT merges it into ə, so u is ə.",
    "Every token is checked against vocab.json when the app starts (voice/js/items.js)."
  ],
